# Keeps the build context small and keeps secrets out of the image.
# Patterns are matched from the context root; "**/" makes them match in nested folders too
# (a plain "*.pem" would only match in the root folder).
**/.git
**/target
**/node_modules
apps/web/dist
# Generated WASM renderer: the Docker image does not build it (no Rust target, no wasm-bindgen CLI in the
# web stage), so a local copy must not leak into the image either. Documented in apps/web/README.md.
apps/web/public/pdf
deploy/secrets
deploy/certs
deploy/.env
deploy/coturn/turnserver.conf
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
